                                                "sense_id": "6d5de5e2-034e-318b-95c0-932b40cf2d37",
                                                "text": "Obsessed, he was after a watch that contained the greatest number of complications in the boldest combinations in the smallest space imaginable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "661f05e4-2aed-48d6-bf9c-f8f57318008e",
                                                "sense_id": "6d5de5e2-034e-318b-95c0-932b40cf2d37",
                                                "text": "In their final year, each student must make their own watch with a complication—from a tourbillon to a chiming mode to having a date display."
